[[The Organization]] sent two choppers to prevent the [[Huntik Foundation]] team from landing in [[:Category:Vienna, Austria|Vienna]]. [[Dante Vale]] and [[Zhalia Moon]] stopped them by summonning [[Metagolem]] and [[King Basilisk]] directly onto the choppers, leading them to crash down. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

Another chopper was sent under [[Wilder]]'s reign to attack the team while they were travelling to [[Tower of Nostradamus]] in France. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}

